\subsubsection{Scope}
Mechanical isolation and sensor anti-alias filtering reduce the input;
Sec.~\ref{sec:engine-noise-guard} measures a software mitigation.
Machinery within the motion band cannot be separated by this front-end
filter. These fixed-heading, zero-speed RAO replays are sensor-path
stress studies, not a prediction of every powered passage.
